# Raw captures never enter the repo. A Claude Code stdout stream and session
# transcript carry operator-home paths and, unless the run disables project
# context, the operator's global CLAUDE.md — which names them and carries their
# email. `AGENTS.md` forbids committing raw trace records or operator PII.
#
# What is committed is `runs/*/evidence.json`, built by `evidence.py`, plus
# `runs/ledger.jsonl` (cost only, no paths). See README.md, "Evidence".
runs/*/events.jsonl
runs/*/stderr.log
runs/*/transcript.jsonl
runs/*/meta.json
workdir/
runs/*.log
